# Rendered episodes and promos. render-ep1/ep2/ep3.mjs default their OUT here,
# and a finished episode is ~100 MB against a repo that rejects any file over
# 10 MB. Video reaches production as a CDN asset with a committed pointer — see
# remotion/scripts/ingest-ep3-clips.mjs — never as a blob in git.
.tmp/

